'''Camo''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade, along with the top portion of the guard, is made up of a camo texture with different shades of green, hence the name. The rest of the guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Camo (Gun)|partner gun]] and [[Camo (Radio)|radio]] under the same name.
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.
